        "tag": "h1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b000002",
      "chapter_id": "ch0001",
      "text": "My name is Mara. My voice is low and rough.",
      "source": {
        "href": "chapter.xhtml",
        "element_id": "p1",
        "tag": "p"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b000003",
      "chapter_id": "ch0001",
      "text": "“Wait,” I said, “the lantern is still warm.”",
      "source": {
        "href": "chapter.xhtml",
        "element_id": "p2",
        "tag": "p"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b000004",
      "chapter_id": "ch0001",
      "text": "Lena answered in a bright, clear voice. “Then someone was here.”",
      "source": {
        "href": "chapter.xhtml",
        "element_id": "p3",
        "tag": "p"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b000005",
      "chapter_id": "ch0001",
      "text": "Lena and I watched the harbor wake.",
      "source": {
        "href": "chapter.xhtml",
        "element_id": "p4",
        "tag": "p"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b000006",
      "chapter_id": "ch0001",
      "text": "“Did you hear that?”",
      "source": {
        "href": "chapter.xhtml",
        "element_id": "p5",
        "tag": "p"
      }
    }
  ],
